{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0324_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "72e3159bd6128c362e3c5ef7139ef5689d9508ee8d283ef6eacea5a2ab921526", "ja": "やだ、外しちゃった！？　うーん……\nカワイイもセクシーと同じくらい奥が深いわね。", "zh": "讨厌，搞砸了吗！？唔——……\n可爱也跟性感一样深奥呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0324_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6a10fbc0d84836c47bbcfee69f83bfffef566fbd9a9eb8d7ac08ecbd1a1dc65b", "ja": "なあ、莉緒？\nもしかして、可愛さを表現してたのか？", "zh": "喂，莉绪？\n难道你刚才是在表现可爱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
