{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0324_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "d56bbed4a5679bd74aef0f57f3f896f6dca50ce15d00f3c96f52f62a6e54fc31", "ja": "ふぅ……。どう、{$P$}くん？\nこんな感じなんだけど……。", "zh": "呼……怎么样，{$P$}？大概就是这种感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
